        DESCRIPTION "The satchel and all of its animaland plant-derived contents are protected from experiencing any natural decay, including rot, mildew, and desiccation.\n\n(Effect: Base 2 as CrCo, +1 Touch, +2 sun, +2 group, +1 requisite; Modifications, +1 level 2 uses per day, +3 levels environmental trigger)"
